        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>Author Comments Layout</title>\n<style>\n  body {\n    font-family: \"SimSun\", \"Songti SC\", \"STSong\", serif;\n    background-color: #e6e6e6;\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: center;\n    padding: 40px 20px;\n    margin: 0;\n    color: #222;\n  }\n  .container {\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: row;\n    gap: 20px;\n    background-color: #f2f2f2;\n    padding: 20px;\n    box-shadow: 0 4px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);\n  }\n  .column {\n    flex: 1;\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n    align-items: center;\n    width: 260px;\n    padding: 10px 20px;\n    background-color: #f2f2f2;\n  }\n  .placeholder {\n    width: 100%;\n    background-color: #ddd;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    text-align: center;\n    margin-bottom: 20px;\n    border: 1px solid #aaa;\n    font-family: sans-serif;\n    font-size: 12px;\n    color: #555;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n    padding: 10px;\n  }\n  .img-col1 {\n    aspect-ratio: 2 / 3;\n  }\n  .img-col2 {\n    aspect-ratio: 1 / 1;\n  }\n  .img-col3 {\n    aspect-ratio: 3 / 4;\n  }\n  .author-name {\n    font-size: 18px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    letter-spacing: 0.8em;\n    margin-bottom: 15px;\n    margin-left: 0.4em; /* To visually center due to letter-spacing */\n  }\n  .separator {\n    width: 90%;\n    border-top: 1px solid #666;\n    margin-bottom: 20px;\n  }\n  .content {\n    width: 100%;\n    font-size: 14px;\n    line-height: 1.8;\n    text-align: justify;\n  }\n  .content p {\n    margin: 0 0 10px 0;\n    text-indent: 2em;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n  <div class=\"container\">\n    <!-- Column 1 -->\n    <div class=\"column\">\n      <div class=\"placeholder img-col1\">\n        [Photo: 2x2 grid of a man in film strip]\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"author-name\">井上雄彦</div>\n      <div class=\"separator\"></div>\n      <div class=\"content\">\n        <p>最近，我突然想养只狗。</p>\n        <p>小时候，我非常喜欢猫、狗之类的动物，记得自己曾经给街坊的狗随便取名叫“卡洛”，跟它一起玩。我现在的街坊也养着一只大狗，名字叫“银次”。当我从隔着差不多跟我一般高的院墙外喊“银次”的时候，它便会伸出大大的脑袋，并把两只大大的前爪搭在院墙上，一直盯着我。每当这时，我就想如果自己养一只大狗该多好啊。</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Column 2 -->\n    <div class=\"column\">\n      <div class=\"placeholder img-col2\">\n        [Drawing: Chibi character head in film strip]\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"author-name\">井上雄彦</div>\n      <div class=\"separator\"></div>\n      <div class=\"content\">\n        <p>刚开始画“灌篮高手”时的愿望，如今已经实现了两个。</p>\n        <p>一个是以采访为名前往美国观看NBA的决赛。另一个也是以采访为名前往巴塞罗那现场观看奥运会。真要感谢上帝。</p>\n        <p>下一个愿望是希望能看到日本篮球队获得奥运会的出线权。那些少年读者曾经在来信中写到：“自从我看了《灌篮高手》后就开始打篮球了”。如果这些孩子们长大之后能实现我的梦想的话……我一定会激动得放声大哭……</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Column 3 -->\n    <div class=\"column\">\n      <div class=\"placeholder img-col3\">\n        [Illustration: Stylized portrait in film strip]\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"author-name\">井上雄彦</div>\n      <div class=\"separator\"></div>\n      <div class=\"content\">\n        <p>多亏大家的支持，《灌篮高手》才能出版第10卷，衷心感谢各位读者朋友。</p>\n        <p>自开始连载已经过去了两年，然而故事中才刚过两个月。如果连载了两年才过两个月的话，那樱木他们升高二的时候岂不是还要等12年，到他们毕业的话，还要等36年……</p>\n        <p>我想不会的……</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</body>\n</html>"
